# ==========================================================================
#  ziziphus/thesis-five
#  The five compounds of the defended screen.
#
#  GENUS-LEVEL. These compounds are documented across Ziziphus species. None
#  of them was isolated from Ziziphus talanai material. R804 refuses any
#  library in this namespace that declares a species scope, so the honesty
#  boundary is enforced by the loader rather than by remembering.
#
#  Identities and reported sources: docking_assets/docking_data/SOURCES.md
#  Structures: canonical SMILES from PubChem, RDKit ETKDGv3 + Meeko 0.7.1
# ==========================================================================

library thesis-five
  scope       genus Ziziphus
  source      PubChem CIDs, with reported occurrences from the literature
  note        Candidate compounds selected at genus level for a species with
              little direct phytochemical characterisation. Predicted binding,
              not demonstrated activity.

  compound    Rutin           C27H30O16  5280805
  reported_in Rutin           Z. jujuba, Z. mauritiana
  compound    Betulinic_Acid  C30H48O3   64971
  reported_in Betulinic_Acid  Z. mauritiana, Z. spina-christi
  compound    Quercetin       C15H10O7   5280343
  reported_in Quercetin       Z. jujuba, Z. spina-christi
  compound    Kaempferol      C15H10O6   5280863
  reported_in Kaempferol      Z. jujuba, Z. mauritiana
  compound    Oleanolic_Acid  C30H48O3   10494
  reported_in Oleanolic_Acid  Z. jujuba, Z. mauritiana, Z. spina-christi
